{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/DALL\u00b7E_2024-12-05_00.19.13_-_A_wide_image_featuring_glowing_neon_text_that_reads__Add_to_Wishlist.__The_text_is_bold_and_vibrant__in_shades_of_pink__blue__and_purple_neon__giving___1_.jpg?t=1745286349\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>a. General Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Street Soccer Online is a fast-paced multiplayer street soccer game that captures the energy and fun of the sport. With no rules to hold you back, this game delivers a pure, exhilarating soccer experience. Play as both a player and a goalkeeper, and immerse yourself in the spirit of street soccer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/calimgoal.gif?t=1745286349\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>b. Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Rules Soccer:</strong> Feel the freedom and dynamism of street soccer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as Both Player and Goalkeeper:</strong> Show your skills in every position on the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast and Fun:</strong> Simple controls make it easy to play, but hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Maps: Various maps are coming soon as the game continues to evolve!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Game Modes: Ball growth mode and ball rain mode available (New game modes coming soon!)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Create strategies with realistic football movements and collisions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/pasortarovasata.gif?t=1745286349\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>c. Game Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Street Soccer Online, the goal is simple: score goals, outplay your opponents, and have fun! Players can dribble, shoot, and tackle on the field or block shots as a goalkeeper. Matches are short and fast-paced, maximizing the excitement and fun factor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/extras/KaymaGiff.gif?t=1745286349\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>d. Developer\u2019s Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;One Developer, One Big Dream&quot;</strong><br>Street Soccer Online is a project built entirely by a solo developer. Capturing the essence of street soccer and sharing it with players has been my ultimate goal. I am committed to improving the game with your feedback and taking it to the next level. Your support on this journey means everything to me!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344400?t=1745286349","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344400?t=1745286349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/db9b5ddae4c06c4f59d51934d33fa68fbcb7766f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745286349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344400/db9b5ddae4c06c4f59d51934d33fa68fbcb7766f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745286349","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets